[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13383.91, "timestamp": "03:43:03", "text": "[音楽]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13387.83, "timestamp": "03:43:07", "text": "紫や青は似合わない。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13392.309, "timestamp": "03:43:12", "text": "いいえ、いいえ、できません。わかった。えっと、見えない"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13406.309, "timestamp": "03:43:26", "text": "えっと、青ですよね？青い目は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13410.309, "timestamp": "03:43:30", "text": "それ。眉毛の色。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13418.87, "timestamp": "03:43:38", "text": "これは私を激しく溶かしているようなものだ。おお。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13427.269, "timestamp": "03:43:47", "text": "[音楽]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13429.51, "timestamp": "03:43:49", "text": "わかった。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13437.75, "timestamp": "03:43:57", "text": "よし、その服にしよう。おお、"}]